<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 69 0 R
/T (Observation: The function correctly extracts most of the information: Amazon, Starbucks, Costco and Kirkland as organisations, last week and 12 March as dates, $15 and $25 as money, and 500 gram as a quantity. It also makes mistakes: Nature Valley \(a brand\) is labelled as a location, the person Rahul and the product Cadbury Dairy Milk are not detected, about 30 grams every morning combines a quantity with a time, and taste in review 4 is tagged as a noun instead of a verb. A larger spaCy model \(such as en_core_web_lg\) or a model trained on product reviews would give more accurate results.)
/E (Observation: The function correctly extracts most of the information: Amazon, Starbucks, Costco and Kirkland as organisations, last week and 12 March as dates, $15 and $25 as money, and 500 gram as a quantity. It also makes mistakes: Nature Valley \(a brand\) is labelled as a location, the person Rahul and the product Cadbury Dairy Milk are not detected, about 30 grams every morning combines a quantity with a time, and taste in review 4 is tagged as a noun instead of a verb. A larger spaCy model \(such as en_core_web_lg\) or a model trained on product reviews would give more accurate results.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [127]
>>
